# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large data & model artefacts — NEVER commit these.
# Per MACHINE-WORKFLOW.md: git carries code, configs and small fixtures only.
# Real data is fetched on demand via scripts/fetch_data.py.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- data/ ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything under data/ is local-only: raw Sentinel-1/2 tiles, the MARIDA
# benchmark, NOAA OSCAR current fields, drifter tracks, GFW vessel records and
# Protected Planet MPA boundaries. Obtain it with scripts/fetch_data.py.
#
# Order matters below: ignore all contents, then re-include directory entries
# so git still descends into them, then re-include the placeholder/doc files.
# (A bare `data/raw/` would exclude the directory outright and git would never
# look inside it — the negations below would silently do nothing.)
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/.gitkeep
!data/**/README.md

# --- models/ -------------------------------------------------------------
# Trained checkpoints stay on the machine that produced them (the workstation).
models/**
!models/**/
!models/.gitkeep
!models/README.md

# Other training/experiment output
checkpoints/
runs/
lightning_logs/
wandb/

# --- belt-and-braces by extension ----------------------------------------
# Catches large files that land outside data/ or models/ by accident.
*.SAFE/
*.jp2
*.tif
*.tiff
*.img
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.7z
*.nc
*.nc4
*.hdf
*.hdf5
*.h5
*.grib
*.grib2
*.shp
*.dbf
*.shx
*.prj
*.gpkg
*.gdb/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.pkl
*.joblib

# Cached intermediate outputs
cache/
.cache/
outputs/
*.parquet
*.feather

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — Copernicus / Global Fishing Watch / Anthropic API credentials
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.yaml
credentials.json
*.pem
*.key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/
.python-version

# Testing / linting caches
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/

# Notebooks
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors, tooling & OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Machine-local Claude Code permission state — differs per machine, not shared.
.claude/settings.local.json

.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
